{"text": "Long ago, the Elephant did not have a trunk. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He had only a short, blackish nose as big as a boot. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He could wiggle it, but he could not pick up anything with it. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then there was a young Elephants Child, and he was full of curiosity. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He was always asking questions about everything. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He asked his tall aunt, the Ostrich, why her tail feathers grew that way. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He asked his tall uncle, the Giraffe, what made his skin spotty. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He asked his broad aunt, the Hippopotamus, why her eyes were red. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Each time, his relatives were cross and gave him a little spank. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> One fine morning he asked a new question, What does the Crocodile have for dinner. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Everybody said, Hush, in a loud and frightened voice.", "alignment": {"characters": ["L", "o", "n", "g", " ", "a", "g", "o", ",", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "E", "l", "e", "p", "h", "a", "n", "t", " ", "d", "i", "d", " ", "n", "o", "t", " ", "h", "a", "v", "e", " ", "a", " ", "t", "r", "u", "n", "k", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "H", "e", " ", "h", "a", "d", " ", "o", "n", "l", "y", " ", "a", " ", "s", "h", "o", "r", "t", ",", " ", "b", "l", "a", "c", "k", "i", "s", "h", " ", "n", "o", "s", "e", " ", "a", "s", " ", "b", "i", "g", " ", "a", "s", " ", "a", " ", "b", "o", "o", "t", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "H", "e", " ", "c", "o", "u", "l", "d", " ", "w", "i", "g", "g", "l", "e", " ", "i", "t", ",", " ", "b", "u", "t", " ", "h", "e", " ", "c", "o", "u", "l", "d", " ", "n", "o", "t", " ", "p", "i", "c", "k", " ", "u", "p", " ", "a", "n", "y", "t", "h", "i", "n", "g", " ", "w", "i", "t", "h", " ", "i", "t", ".", " ", "<"